{"sha":"99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","node_id":"C_kwDOPm8esNoAKDk5ZDYyOTVhMjM0NDRiZjhjYmNlNWNkYTY4MDUxZGM1OWEzZmYyZDE","commit":{"author":{"name":"Runonthespot","email":"mike.renwick@gmail.com","date":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"},"message":"Fix/add command argument parsing (#44)\n\n* fix: resolve --add command argument parsing issue\n\nWhen using `ck --add /path/to/file`, the file path was incorrectly\nparsed as the pattern argument instead of being recognized as the\nfile to add. This fix ensures that --add properly handles file paths\nwhether provided as the first positional argument (pattern) or in the\nfiles array.\n\nAdded comprehensive integration tests to prevent regression.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: handle empty regex pattern correctly to match grep/ripgrep behavior\n\nEmpty patterns were matching at every position in a line, causing massive\nduplication in output. Now matches each line exactly once, consistent with\nhow grep and ripgrep handle empty patterns.\n\nAlso updated UNEXPECTED.md with discovered issues during AX testing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 0.4.4\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md with fixes for --add argument parsing and empty\npattern behavior. Updated all crate versions and PRD.txt version reference.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/trees/5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/git/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoxX7tCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA05QQABodgWIjgJM4rpeksoAL2d/2\ny8QmaGyqky9akz3Y81QBAzwbgevHUCddmRXlFfEQMSX0jQ0o4LDrr0UF3q+Mc4Ep\nA/JofHARGtsRTWpsr5RUDuuheqZDEbzGRdT0YhY4jC1p5yiMVq82kjRlb6Rb5GU2\n7dELVISqO+HJ2aAfg3gLg13S3yRFual7ZgXaJkRnx9CVsH1MezYZ4pyY761uokIl\nFLNLNLC2yfW3u4YxPx8vIC1/E3nOr8ZZTcvL8yu96B4QbYSA6xhfGICRoJjPT2mg\nA8SyZJygIyjY5P16Y6JyOEN8FtXiQJriJ3E6FSJtRn5j3Uxuzt0gcADnc7CSvnNU\nrePCzFVKQt4eR/jLvXZ1tLgYzvzEvmGqPXJSQmyEuJRwJ2vWIQrS0p19+afVJfP+\nfhARJkfZXdwVEcIYu8WfQ7P3cnRu1a6sHSt24f9xGpRcHy9GCbD8QWyb2G9mMLVj\nHkko6P0ohz7Nnrs4ISqNjqooSdNoTkiy9e+8cY5gg6o8xRbq6BAiamuFS0vr67k/\n74z4xS+F4qznmzxK4fePYdbEpScsQw/gUdAJI9A/2NDUJwsKuUSCt7F2m2H/yX2f\nA5wzPqk+Zyk8VS+Mn+FNuZvMye6Yv8c47OfcfyX6XxkwlOd4YjOE3XBWOKqAfiCl\nvZ+N6lWBhodYz+n7r5C6\n=qf41\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 5d469f5ed13546f947ffee18c48e569d333be301\nparent e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca\nauthor Runonthespot <mike.renwick@gmail.com> 1757773549 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1757773549 +0100\n\nFix/add command argument parsing (#44)\n\n* fix: resolve --add command argument parsing issue\n\nWhen using `ck --add /path/to/file`, the file path was incorrectly\nparsed as the pattern argument instead of being recognized as the\nfile to add. This fix ensures that --add properly handles file paths\nwhether provided as the first positional argument (pattern) or in the\nfiles array.\n\nAdded comprehensive integration tests to prevent regression.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: handle empty regex pattern correctly to match grep/ripgrep behavior\n\nEmpty patterns were matching at every position in a line, causing massive\nduplication in output. Now matches each line exactly once, consistent with\nhow grep and ripgrep handle empty patterns.\n\nAlso updated UNEXPECTED.md with discovered issues during AX testing.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: bump version to 0.4.4\n\nUpdated CHANGELOG.md with fixes for --add argument parsing and empty\npattern behavior. Updated all crate versions and PRD.txt version reference.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2025-09-13T14:25:49Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","html_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/commit/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/comments","author":{"login":"runonthespot","id":634732,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNDczMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/634732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot","html_url":"https://github.com/runonthespot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/runonthespot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/commits/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca","html_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/commit/e77e792220f243f8e4c7a4739d5fd5a2098429ca"}],"stats":{"total":267,"additions":226,"deletions":41},"files":[{"sha":"f2056dcafbd5ec2ce31da1590ad76b92dc46f844","filename":"CHANGELOG.md","status":"modified","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/CHANGELOG.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/CHANGELOG.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/CHANGELOG.md?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -2,6 +2,12 @@\n \n All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n \n+## [0.4.4] - 2025-09-13\n+\n+### Fixed\n+- **`--add` command argument parsing**: Fixed issue where file paths were incorrectly parsed as pattern arguments, preventing single file additions to the index\n+- **Empty pattern behavior**: Empty regex patterns now match each line once (consistent with grep/ripgrep) instead of matching at every character position causing massive duplication\n+\n ## [0.4.3] - 2025-09-13\n \n ### Added"},{"sha":"e2036e436f11174c2a72de1b501aae3e82985a60","filename":"Cargo.lock","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":8,"changes":16,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/Cargo.lock","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/Cargo.lock","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/Cargo.lock?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -405,7 +405,7 @@ checksum = \"613afe47fcd5fac7ccf1db93babcb082c5994d996f20b8b159f2ad1658eb5724\"\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-ann\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"bincode\",\n@@ -416,7 +416,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-chunk\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"ck-core\",\n@@ -433,7 +433,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-core\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"bincode\",\n@@ -447,7 +447,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-embed\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"ck-core\",\n@@ -458,7 +458,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-engine\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"ck-ann\",\n@@ -480,7 +480,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-index\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"bincode\",\n@@ -503,7 +503,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-models\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"ck-core\",\n@@ -513,7 +513,7 @@ dependencies = [\n \n [[package]]\n name = \"ck-search\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n dependencies = [\n  \"anyhow\",\n  \"ck-ann\","},{"sha":"b2fe5fdacfb7b18a8d9e602a4d4b9e438ea79437","filename":"Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/Cargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/Cargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/Cargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -12,7 +12,7 @@ members = [\n ]\n \n [workspace.package]\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n edition = \"2024\"\n authors = [\"Mike Renwick\"]\n license = \"MIT OR Apache-2.0\""},{"sha":"4e7f3108f7ff83b297fe0b03721db06a87c823de","filename":"PRD.txt","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/PRD.txt","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/PRD.txt","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/PRD.txt?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -289,7 +289,7 @@ ck/\n \n ---\n \n-## Current Implementation Status (v0.4.1)\n+## Current Implementation Status (v0.4.4)\n \n ### ✅ **Production Ready Features**\n - **Complete grep replacement**: All major flags supported with identical behavior"},{"sha":"056b2f957b6ed8cf7fabe55477f8c6fe4ce8a706","filename":"UNEXPECTED.md","status":"modified","additions":24,"deletions":1,"changes":25,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/UNEXPECTED.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/UNEXPECTED.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/UNEXPECTED.md?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -14,7 +14,30 @@ This file tracks instances where ck behaves unexpectedly during testing or usage\n \n ## Issues Found\n \n-*(No issues recorded yet)*\n+**Command:** `ck \"\"`\n+**Expected:** Error message or no results\n+**Actual:** Massive output with every empty line in the codebase being matched\n+**Date:** 2025-09-13\n+**Status:** Open\n+**Notes:** Empty pattern matches all empty lines, resulting in overwhelming output. Perhaps should warn or limit results?\n+\n+---\n+\n+**Command:** `ck --add /tmp/test.txt`\n+**Expected:** Add file to index or meaningful error\n+**Actual:** Error: \"No file specified. Usage: ck --add <file>\"\n+**Date:** 2025-09-13\n+**Status:** Open\n+**Notes:** The error message is incorrect - a file was specified. Seems like argument parsing issue.\n+\n+---\n+\n+**Command:** `ck --sem \"🎉🦀✨\"`\n+**Expected:** No results or error about emoji patterns\n+**Actual:** Returns seemingly random code results\n+**Date:** 2025-09-13\n+**Status:** Open\n+**Notes:** Emoji search returns unrelated results. The semantic embedding seems to handle emojis unpredictably.\n \n ---\n "},{"sha":"c220c12ba69e1a440d80cb971fa46d028f87d728","filename":"ck-ann/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-ann%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-ann%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-ann%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ keywords = [\"search\", \"ann\", \"vector\"]\n categories = [\"algorithms\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n serde = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"78d98b3512b46c17461e154faf7bd3172e8ec307","filename":"ck-chunk/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-chunk%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-chunk%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-chunk%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ keywords = [\"parsing\", \"chunking\", \"tree-sitter\"]\n categories = [\"parsing\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n serde = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"9ca37c265ea51c7eaefe8e1511f4e53d1d2b0100","filename":"ck-cli/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":8,"changes":16,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-cli%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@\n [package]\n name = \"ck-search\"\n-version = \"0.4.3\"\n+version = \"0.4.4\"\n edition = \"2024\"\n authors = [\"Mike Renwick\"]\n license = \"MIT OR Apache-2.0\"\n@@ -17,13 +17,13 @@ name = \"ck\"\n path = \"src/main.rs\"\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n-ck-index = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-index\" }\n-ck-engine = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-engine\" }\n-ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n-ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n-ck-ann = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-ann\" }\n-ck-models = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-models\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-index = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-index\" }\n+ck-engine = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-engine\" }\n+ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n+ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n+ck-ann = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-ann\" }\n+ck-models = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-models\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n clap = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"7e22146326e10c9412a29643f7d35bcbadb2205c","filename":"ck-cli/src/main.rs","status":"modified","additions":19,"deletions":5,"changes":24,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-cli%2Fsrc%2Fmain.rs?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -582,11 +582,25 @@ async fn run_main() -> Result<()> {\n \n     if cli.add {\n         // Handle --add flag\n-        let file = cli\n-            .files\n-            .first()\n-            .cloned()\n-            .ok_or_else(|| anyhow::anyhow!(\"No file specified. Usage: ck --add <file>\"))?;\n+        // When using --add, the file path might be in pattern or files\n+        let file = if let Some(ref pattern) = cli.pattern {\n+            // If pattern is provided and no files, use pattern as the file path\n+            if cli.files.is_empty() {\n+                PathBuf::from(pattern)\n+            } else {\n+                // Otherwise use the first file\n+                cli.files\n+                    .first()\n+                    .cloned()\n+                    .ok_or_else(|| anyhow::anyhow!(\"No file specified. Usage: ck --add <file>\"))?\n+            }\n+        } else {\n+            // No pattern, must be in files\n+            cli.files\n+                .first()\n+                .cloned()\n+                .ok_or_else(|| anyhow::anyhow!(\"No file specified. Usage: ck --add <file>\"))?\n+        };\n         status.section_header(\"Adding File to Index\");\n         status.info(&format!(\"Processing {}\", file.display()));\n "},{"sha":"eaded797f271dbe654d383f6fa710e9e86d1a51a","filename":"ck-cli/tests/integration_tests.rs","status":"modified","additions":105,"deletions":0,"changes":105,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2Ftests%2Fintegration_tests.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-cli%2Ftests%2Fintegration_tests.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-cli%2Ftests%2Fintegration_tests.rs?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -617,3 +617,108 @@ fn test_jsonl_with_different_languages() {\n     assert!(python_found);\n     assert!(js_found);\n }\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn test_add_single_file_to_index() {\n+    let temp_dir = TempDir::new().unwrap();\n+\n+    // Create a test file to add\n+    let test_file = temp_dir.path().join(\"test_file.txt\");\n+    fs::write(&test_file, \"This is test content for indexing\").unwrap();\n+\n+    // First create an index in the directory\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"--index\", \".\"])\n+        .current_dir(temp_dir.path())\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to create index\");\n+\n+    assert!(output.status.success(), \"Failed to create initial index\");\n+\n+    // Create another file after index creation\n+    let new_file = temp_dir.path().join(\"new_file.txt\");\n+    fs::write(&new_file, \"New file content to be added\").unwrap();\n+\n+    // Test adding the new file with absolute path\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"--add\", new_file.to_str().unwrap()])\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to run ck --add\");\n+\n+    assert!(\n+        output.status.success(),\n+        \"Failed to add file: stderr: {}, stdout: {}\",\n+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stderr),\n+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stdout)\n+    );\n+\n+    let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();\n+    let stderr = String::from_utf8(output.stderr).unwrap();\n+\n+    // Check for success message in either stdout or stderr\n+    assert!(\n+        stdout.contains(\"Added\") || stderr.contains(\"Added\"),\n+        \"Expected 'Added' in output, got stdout: {}, stderr: {}\",\n+        stdout,\n+        stderr\n+    );\n+\n+    // Verify the file was actually added by searching for it\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"New file\", \".\"])\n+        .current_dir(temp_dir.path())\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to search for added file\");\n+\n+    assert!(output.status.success());\n+    let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();\n+    assert!(\n+        stdout.contains(\"New file content\"),\n+        \"Added file content not found in search\"\n+    );\n+}\n+\n+#[test]\n+fn test_add_file_with_relative_path() {\n+    let temp_dir = TempDir::new().unwrap();\n+\n+    // Create index first\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"--index\", \".\"])\n+        .current_dir(temp_dir.path())\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to create index\");\n+\n+    assert!(output.status.success());\n+\n+    // Create a new file to add\n+    fs::write(\n+        temp_dir.path().join(\"relative_file.txt\"),\n+        \"Relative path content\",\n+    )\n+    .unwrap();\n+\n+    // Test adding with relative path from the temp directory\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"--add\", \"relative_file.txt\"])\n+        .current_dir(temp_dir.path())\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to run ck --add with relative path\");\n+\n+    assert!(\n+        output.status.success(),\n+        \"Failed to add file with relative path: {}\",\n+        String::from_utf8_lossy(&output.stderr)\n+    );\n+\n+    // Verify file was added\n+    let output = Command::new(get_ck_binary())\n+        .args([\"Relative path\", \".\"])\n+        .current_dir(temp_dir.path())\n+        .output()\n+        .expect(\"Failed to search\");\n+\n+    assert!(output.status.success());\n+    let stdout = String::from_utf8(output.stdout).unwrap();\n+    assert!(stdout.contains(\"Relative path content\"));\n+}"},{"sha":"68efedee95ad40cc21ec2cb765b2840306d7b5ca","filename":"ck-embed/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-embed%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-embed%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-embed%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ keywords = [\"embedding\", \"nlp\", \"semantic\"]\n categories = [\"science\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n serde = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"c5938f6378d4c0b35c7016b023c7583be08928e3","filename":"ck-engine/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":5,"deletions":5,"changes":10,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-engine%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-engine%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-engine%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,11 +11,11 @@ keywords = [\"search\", \"engine\", \"semantic\"]\n categories = [\"algorithms\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n-ck-index = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-index\" }\n-ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n-ck-ann = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-ann\" }\n-ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-index = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-index\" }\n+ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n+ck-ann = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-ann\" }\n+ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n serde_json = { workspace = true }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"23451fefa8fde26b0026704cf76995ba9ed337eb","filename":"ck-engine/src/lib.rs","status":"modified","additions":41,"deletions":4,"changes":45,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-engine%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-engine%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-engine%2Fsrc%2Flib.rs?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -173,8 +173,10 @@ fn search_file(\n     for (line_idx, line) in lines.iter().enumerate() {\n         let line_number = line_idx + 1;\n \n-        // Find all matches in the line with their positions\n-        for mat in regex.find_iter(line) {\n+        // Special handling for empty pattern - match the entire line once\n+        // An empty regex pattern will match at every position, so we need to handle it specially\n+        if regex.as_str().is_empty() {\n+            // Empty pattern matches the whole line once (grep compatibility)\n             let preview = if options.full_section {\n                 // Try to find the containing code section\n                 if let Some(ref sections) = code_sections {\n@@ -194,8 +196,8 @@ fn search_file(\n             results.push(SearchResult {\n                 file: file_path.to_path_buf(),\n                 span: Span {\n-                    byte_start: byte_offset + mat.start(),\n-                    byte_end: byte_offset + mat.end(),\n+                    byte_start: byte_offset,\n+                    byte_end: byte_offset + line.len(),\n                     line_start: line_number,\n                     line_end: line_number,\n                 },\n@@ -206,6 +208,41 @@ fn search_file(\n                 chunk_hash: None,\n                 index_epoch: None,\n             });\n+        } else {\n+            // Find all matches in the line with their positions\n+            for mat in regex.find_iter(line) {\n+                let preview = if options.full_section {\n+                    // Try to find the containing code section\n+                    if let Some(ref sections) = code_sections {\n+                        if let Some(section) = find_containing_section(sections, line_idx) {\n+                            section.clone()\n+                        } else {\n+                            // Fall back to context lines if no section found\n+                            get_context_preview(&lines, line_idx, options)\n+                        }\n+                    } else {\n+                        get_context_preview(&lines, line_idx, options)\n+                    }\n+                } else {\n+                    get_context_preview(&lines, line_idx, options)\n+                };\n+\n+                results.push(SearchResult {\n+                    file: file_path.to_path_buf(),\n+                    span: Span {\n+                        byte_start: byte_offset + mat.start(),\n+                        byte_end: byte_offset + mat.end(),\n+                        line_start: line_number,\n+                        line_end: line_number,\n+                    },\n+                    score: 1.0,\n+                    preview,\n+                    lang: ck_core::Language::from_path(file_path),\n+                    symbol: None,\n+                    chunk_hash: None,\n+                    index_epoch: None,\n+                });\n+            }\n         }\n \n         // Update byte offset for next line (add line length + newline character)"},{"sha":"cea14c16242d0ddefb32be105dede1a0931b25f2","filename":"ck-index/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":4,"deletions":4,"changes":8,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-index%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-index%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-index%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,10 +11,10 @@ keywords = [\"indexing\", \"search\", \"storage\"]\n categories = [\"database-implementations\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n-ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n-ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n-ck-models = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-models\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-chunk = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-chunk\" }\n+ck-embed = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-embed\" }\n+ck-models = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-models\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n serde = { workspace = true }"},{"sha":"ff6f7480fa7caf64e0c20af13d85f3bf02bf347e","filename":"ck-models/Cargo.toml","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/blob/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-models%2FCargo.toml","raw_url":"https://github.com/BeaconBay/ck/raw/99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1/ck-models%2FCargo.toml","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BeaconBay/ck/contents/ck-models%2FCargo.toml?ref=99d6295a23444bf8cbce5cda68051dc59a3ff2d1","patch":"@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ keywords = [\"models\", \"config\", \"registry\"]\n categories = [\"config\"]\n \n [dependencies]\n-ck-core = { version = \"0.4.3\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n+ck-core = { version = \"0.4.4\", path = \"../ck-core\" }\n \n anyhow = { workspace = true }\n serde = { workspace = true }"}]}